    {
      "key": "exercise-135",
      "serialized": "在坐标平面上，画细线条表示由下列不等式组给出的点的集合： a) [[MATH:0]] b) [[MATH:1]] c) [[MATH:2]] d) [[MATH:3]]",
      "lines": [
        "在坐标平面上，画细线条表示由下列不等式组给出的点的集合：",
        "a) [[MATH:0]]",
        "b) [[MATH:1]]",
        "c) [[MATH:2]]",
        "d) [[MATH:3]]"
      ],
      "formulas": [
        {
          "tex": "\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\leqslant0.64,\\\\y&\\geqslant0;\\end{aligned}\\right.",
          "visible": true,
          "nonempty": true
        },
        {
          "tex": "\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\geqslant4,\\\\x^2+y^2&\\leqslant16;\\end{aligned}\\right.",
          "visible": true,
          "nonempty": true
        },
        {
          "tex": "\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\leqslant16,\\\\y&\\geqslant4-x;\\end{aligned}\\right.",
          "visible": true,
          "nonempty": true
        },
        {
          "tex": "\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant x^2,\\\\y-4&\\leqslant0.\\end{aligned}\\right.",
          "visible": true,
          "nonempty": true
        }
      ],
